 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Taming a Munchkin"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "먼치킨 길들이기"
   },
   {
    "ko-ro": "Munchkin Gildeurigi"
   },
   {
    "en": "Taming the Overpowered"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "She was reborn as the antagonist of a fantasy novel, a child who bears her family’s resentment.\n\nAs it stands, her fate is to end up on the guillotine at the hands of the furious villagers!\n\nKynemeia, for the sake of a comfortable future, plans to gather some Munchkins to govern the fief. However, there’s one problem…\n\nKynemeia stared blankly at the boy sitting in the underground prison.\n\n“…Why?”\n\n“I got caught.”\n\nShe’s on the receiving end of an unwanted obsession from a suspicious mage?!\n\nThis is the story of the struggles of a Grand Duke’s daughter who wishes to transform her life\n\nand the Munchkin mage who feigns innocence!"
  },
